[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "turn_index": 0,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.886,
    "start": 0.0,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "大家好，欢迎来到《本体工程与知识图谱实战》第三集。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "turn_index": 0,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 8.957,
    "start": 3.886,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "上一集我们学会了用 RDF 三元组写事实，这一集先不急着打开建模工具，而是解决一个更早的问题：我们到底为什么要画这张本体？"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "turn_index": 1,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.943,
    "start": 12.843,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "很多项目一开始就建类、建属性，几小时后得到一张很大的图，却没人说得清它应该回答什么。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "turn_index": 1,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.4,
    "start": 18.786,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "今天我们用 Competency Questions，也就是 CQ，把“帮我选 GPU 云服务”变成一组可以检查、可以交付的问题。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "turn_index": 2,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.067,
    "start": 25.186,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "本期有四步。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "turn_index": 2,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 8.152,
    "start": 26.252,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "先弄清 CQ 的职责，再识别坏问题，然后把一句需求拆成建模信号并排优先级，最后把它连接到数据和查询测试。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "turn_index": 3,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.905,
    "start": 34.405,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "有意把 Protégé 放到下一集。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "turn_index": 3,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.068,
    "start": 36.31,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "今天的产物不是一张漂亮的类层级，而是一份让下一集知道该建什么、又不该建什么的需求清单。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "turn_index": 4,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.114,
    "start": 42.377,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "先给 CQ 一个工作定义：它是用自然语言表达的本体功能需求。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "turn_index": 4,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 6.171,
    "start": 46.491,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "听起来很像软件需求，只不过它问的是，这套知识模型应该具备回答哪些问题的能力。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "turn_index": 5,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.514,
    "start": 52.663,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "对，而且同一条 CQ 同时做三件事。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "turn_index": 5,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.276,
    "start": 55.177,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "它声明需求，限定本体范围，还提供验收线索。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "turn_index": 5,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 7.74,
    "start": 58.453,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "比如“哪些计算服务支持 GPU，并在东京可用”，这句话已经暗示我们至少需要计算服务、区域、GPU 支持和服务到区域的关系。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "turn_index": 6,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.81,
    "start": 66.193,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "那 CQ 是不是未来产品搜索框里必须原样出现的问题？"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 0.762,
    "start": 70.003,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "不一定。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.81,
    "start": 70.765,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "产品界面可以换一种说法，也可以把多个 CQ 组合成推荐流程。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.886,
    "start": 74.574,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "CQ 的核心用途是让业务人员、领域专家和建模者对齐。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "start": 78.46,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 3,
    "text": "写 CQ 时也不要求已经会写 SPARQL，但必须能说明未来怎样验证答案。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "turn_index": 8,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.018,
    "start": 83.26,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "来看最常见的反例：“请推荐最好的 GPU 云服务。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "turn_index": 8,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.905,
    "start": 87.278,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "”这不是很像真实用户会问的吗？"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "turn_index": 8,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.752,
    "start": 89.183,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "为什么不能直接拿它做需求？"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "turn_index": 9,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.524,
    "start": 90.935,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "因为“最好”没有评价维度。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "turn_index": 9,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.81,
    "start": 92.459,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "是月费最低、显存最大、东京可用，还是迁移成本最低？"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "turn_index": 9,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.495,
    "start": 96.269,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "不同团队给出的答案都可能合理，最终也就无法判断本体到底有没有完成。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "turn_index": 10,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.905,
    "start": 100.764,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "可是真实业务本来就模糊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "turn_index": 10,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 6.4,
    "start": 102.669,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "如果一开始要求用户把区域、预算、币种、计费周期都说清楚，会不会过度工程化？"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "turn_index": 11,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.276,
    "start": 109.069,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "业务入口可以模糊，甚至应该允许用户只说一句话；"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "turn_index": 11,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.804,
    "start": 112.345,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "但进入本体需求后，关键口径必须显式化。"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "turn_index": 11,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.886,
    "start": 115.149,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "否则模糊性不是被解决了，只是被藏进开发者的默认假设里。"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.81,
    "start": 119.034,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "所以我们不是禁止“推荐”，而是把推荐拆成可说明的判断。"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 6.552,
    "start": 122.844,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "比如先筛选东京或新加坡可用、支持 GPU 的服务，再按统一时间点的美元月费排序。"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "turn_index": 13,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.057,
    "start": 129.396,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "还要问“同规格”到底指什么。"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "turn_index": 13,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.257,
    "start": 131.453,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "实例系列、显存、虚拟处理器、运行时长和折扣条件都可能影响比较。"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "turn_index": 13,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.038,
    "start": 136.71,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "只要这些边界没有定义，“便宜”和“合适”就仍然是漂移的词。"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "turn_index": 14,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.895,
    "start": 140.749,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "为了实操，我们给好 CQ 设四个检查点。"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "turn_index": 14,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.124,
    "start": 143.644,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "第一个是具体，也就是对象和关系明确；"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "turn_index": 14,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.819,
    "start": 146.768,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "第二个是有界，范围和口径明确。"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "turn_index": 15,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.267,
    "start": 149.587,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第三个是可答：能够列出需要哪些数据，以及数据可能从哪里来。"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "turn_index": 15,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.743,
    "start": 153.853,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "注意，可答不等于今天数据已经齐全；"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "turn_index": 15,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.505,
    "start": 156.596,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "记录一个明确的数据缺口，也比假装它不存在更有价值。"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "turn_index": 16,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.219,
    "start": 160.101,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第四个是可验。"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "turn_index": 16,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.41,
    "start": 161.32,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "我们要知道答案是一张列表、一个布尔值、一条路径，还是按某个指标排序的结果。"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "turn_index": 16,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.429,
    "start": 166.73,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "否则即使系统返回一段文字，也很难稳定比较对错。"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "turn_index": 17,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 10.477,
    "start": 170.158,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "拿“哪些计算服务支持 GPU，并在东京或新加坡可用”检查一次：对象和关系明确，区域有边界，厂商文档能提供数据，答案可以是服务、厂商和区域的列表。"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "turn_index": 17,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.743,
    "start": 180.635,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "它就比“推荐最好的”更适合作为本体需求。"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "turn_index": 18,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.352,
    "start": 183.378,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "下一步，把一句自然语言问题拆成四类信号。"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "turn_index": 18,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.501,
    "start": 186.73,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "先看名词：“厂商”“计算服务”“东京”。"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "turn_index": 18,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.752,
    "start": 189.23,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "它们看起来像类或实体。"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "turn_index": 19,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.121,
    "start": 190.983,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "但不要机械地把每个名词都建成类。"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "turn_index": 19,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.448,
    "start": 193.104,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "计算服务可能是类，东京更可能是区域类的一个实体，厂商既可以是类名，也可能指某个具体供应商。"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "turn_index": 19,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.59,
    "start": 199.552,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "粒度要看问题准备怎样使用这些概念。"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "turn_index": 20,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.657,
    "start": 202.143,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "然后看关系：“厂商提供服务”“服务在区域可用”。"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "turn_index": 20,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.267,
    "start": 205.8,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "它们会提示 hasProvider 和 hasRegion 这样的候选对象属性。"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "turn_index": 21,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.742,
    "start": 210.067,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "再看条件：“支持 GPU”。"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "turn_index": 21,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.41,
    "start": 211.809,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "它可能映射成布尔数据属性，也可能随着项目成熟变成更细的 GPU 型号与规格结构。"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "turn_index": 21,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.571,
    "start": 217.218,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "CQ 提供建模信号，但不会自动替我们决定唯一正确的 OWL 设计。"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "turn_index": 22,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 0.914,
    "start": 221.79,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "最后是输出。"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "turn_index": 22,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.048,
    "start": 222.704,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "这个问题不只要服务名称，还要厂商和区域。"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "turn_index": 22,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.157,
    "start": 225.751,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "输出字段会成为以后查询里的变量，也提醒我们答案需要保留哪些上下文。"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "turn_index": 23,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.41,
    "start": 230.909,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "还有一个边界：问题里的价格上限属于查询过滤条件，不一定要写成 OWL 公理；"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "turn_index": 23,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.724,
    "start": 236.318,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "“每个服务必须有一个厂商”这种质量要求，也更可能由 SHACL 约束。"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "turn_index": 23,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.743,
    "start": 241.042,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "不要看到限定条件就全部塞进同一种语言。"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "turn_index": 24,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.048,
    "start": 243.785,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "现在现场改写“帮我选择 GPU 云服务”。"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "turn_index": 24,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.952,
    "start": 246.832,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "第一条 CQ：哪些计算服务支持 GPU，并在东京或新加坡区域可用？"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "turn_index": 24,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.133,
    "start": 251.785,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "输出服务、厂商和区域。"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "turn_index": 25,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.886,
    "start": 253.918,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第二条：在这些候选服务中，哪些提供公开的免费额度？"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "turn_index": 25,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.124,
    "start": 257.804,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "输出免费额度状态、证据来源和更新时间。"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "turn_index": 25,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.667,
    "start": 260.928,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "没有记录时返回未知，不要擅自回答“没有”。"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "turn_index": 26,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 7.665,
    "start": 263.594,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第三条：在相同规格、同一区域、同一计费周期和美元口径下，指定日期有哪些服务的月费低于预算？"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "turn_index": 26,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.819,
    "start": 271.259,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "这条明显需要更多价格与规格数据。"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "turn_index": 27,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.124,
    "start": 274.078,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "有人会说，为什么不把三条合成一个完整推荐问题？"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "turn_index": 27,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.829,
    "start": 277.202,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "合在一起更接近最终产品。"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "turn_index": 28,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 6.221,
    "start": 279.03,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "但合成以后，只要最终没有结果，我们就不知道是区域、GPU、免费额度还是价格数据出了问题。"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "turn_index": 28,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.733,
    "start": 285.25,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "拆开的 CQ 更方便定位缺口和编写回归测试。"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "turn_index": 29,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 0.533,
    "start": 288.984,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "没错。"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "turn_index": 29,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.352,
    "start": 289.517,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "应用层仍然可以组合三条查询，生成一次推荐；"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "turn_index": 29,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.343,
    "start": 292.87,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "需求层保持单一判断，能让建模、数据采集和验收更清晰。"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "turn_index": 29,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.133,
    "start": 297.212,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 3,
    "text": "这是分解，不是把真实业务割裂掉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "turn_index": 30,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.057,
    "start": 299.346,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "问题一多，就需要优先级。"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "turn_index": 30,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.501,
    "start": 301.403,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "这里借用 Must、Should、Nice 三档。"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "turn_index": 30,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.267,
    "start": 303.904,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "Must 不是“老板最喜欢”，而是没有它就无法完成核心交付。"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "turn_index": 31,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.895,
    "start": 308.17,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "在我们的项目里，GPU 支持与可用区域是 Must；"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "turn_index": 31,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.676,
    "start": 311.066,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "免费额度可以先列为 Should；"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "turn_index": 31,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.114,
    "start": 312.742,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "跨云托管迁移路径证据昂贵、边界复杂，可以先放在 Nice。"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "turn_index": 32,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.733,
    "start": 316.856,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "团队经常把所有问题都标成 Must，最后还是没有顺序。"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "turn_index": 32,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.524,
    "start": 320.59,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "有什么简单的纠偏方法？"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "turn_index": 33,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.257,
    "start": 322.113,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "给每个 Must 写一句“如果没有答案，哪项交付会失败”，再指定负责人和复审条件。"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "turn_index": 33,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.438,
    "start": 327.37,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "如果说不出具体影响，它大概率不是 Must。"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "turn_index": 33,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.657,
    "start": 329.809,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "优先级也不是永久标签，会随数据成本和项目目标调整。"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "turn_index": 34,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.59,
    "start": 333.466,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "最后，把 CQ 落到一条可追踪链上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "turn_index": 34,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 9.143,
    "start": 336.056,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "以 GPU 区域问题为例，概念包括 ComputeService、CloudProvider 和 Region，关系包括 hasProvider、hasRegion，条件包括 hasGPU。"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "turn_index": 35,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 7.619,
    "start": 345.199,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "然后列数据来源：厂商服务目录告诉我们服务与厂商，区域列表告诉我们可用地点，规格文档提供 GPU 支持。"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "turn_index": 35,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.895,
    "start": 352.818,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "每条记录还应该保留证据链接和更新时间。"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "turn_index": 36,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.461,
    "start": 355.713,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "到了查询阶段，我们把同一条 CQ 写成 SPARQL，准备一个固定的小数据集和预期结果。"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "turn_index": 36,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.724,
    "start": 361.174,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "这样本体变化以后，可以重新运行查询检查是否破坏了原有能力。"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "turn_index": 37,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.505,
    "start": 365.898,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "这里最危险的误区是把空结果直接解释成“没有这种服务”。"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "turn_index": 37,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.171,
    "start": 369.403,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "在开放世界里，空结果也可能表示区域没采集、属性没建、映射错了，或者查询本身写错了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "turn_index": 38,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 7.467,
    "start": 375.574,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "所以验收不只是看有没有返回行，还要区分四种状态：确实没有、模型缺失、数据缺失、查询错误。"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "turn_index": 38,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.286,
    "start": 383.041,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "CQ 帮我们把失败位置说清楚。"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "turn_index": 39,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 6.144,
    "start": 385.327,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "仓库里的追踪表已经为六条核心 CQ 写明优先级、答案形式、所需数据和候选本体元素。"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "turn_index": 39,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.419,
    "start": 391.47,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "下一集建模时，我们不会凭感觉添加概念，而是逐条消费这份输入。"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "turn_index": 40,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 0.686,
    "start": 395.89,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "总结一下。"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "turn_index": 40,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.895,
    "start": 396.575,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "CQ 同时定义本体的需求、范围和验收；"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "turn_index": 40,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.943,
    "start": 399.47,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "模糊业务问题可以保留在入口，但进入需求清单后，必须删除没有定义的“最好”和“合适”。"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "turn_index": 41,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.886,
    "start": 405.413,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "每条 Must 都要映射到明确的数据需求，并规定答案形式。"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "turn_index": 41,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.886,
    "start": 409.299,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "CQ 提供建模信号，却不会自动决定所有类、属性和约束；"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "turn_index": 41,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.829,
    "start": 413.185,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "那些选择还需要领域判断。"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "turn_index": 42,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 8.425,
    "start": 415.013,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "课后可以为自己的领域写五条 CQ，标注优先级、答案形式和所需数据，再检查里面是否还藏着“最好”“合适”“便宜”这样的未定义词。"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "turn_index": 43,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 5.081,
    "start": 423.438,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "下一集，我们会把今天的概念与关系带进 Protégé，建立第一个可维护的本体骨架。"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "turn_index": 43,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.59,
    "start": 428.519,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "谢谢收听，我们下一集见。"
  }
]